 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Co6aVv2nGA0Q7kNvwE2jaBv&_nc_oc=AdrPm1LUxG2bjYqKAX6ZdjVIXXLIOWsULOM7eqe86Oo2Wt83bYQ5A6dXWKZx263V1zw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSjIfbKBVLcUl4768f3w5RZ1V6VG1nYammOsa3DM9xagw&oe=6AE9FB41"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TmELCXLbKcoQ7kNvwG1djwj&_nc_oc=AdopQgeNJo-8DPdIQEDaM42idyqEaM6am440tFUeKPWYOr26mjYrV0HIXHarqtsNbaM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSUgxOr9kTsCs834yfxv097w41VteS2qtPjQIG8yPKYzg&oe=6AEA08A6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DNjFAMOXTVkQ7kNvwFjZvTH&_nc_oc=Adp8JrADp9TVCIlsigKaSpl8T3MLM_EBgCgf9GEQksBLPY4gaoShDaXSE04gtDZVSfI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTPb_KY8OypYL8F2WaZBB1HV2pnIeV5XaPN2MnIKdTsQA&oe=6AEA129C"}, {"fil